# UX workflow: compare every Gate 4 curve family at the full Macro editor size.
# Purpose: proves smooth Sine/Triangle, intentional Saw/Square discontinuities,
# and the shared Recorded Shape path without opening the Gate 5 source editor.
# Expect: capture_changed:sine=triangle, capture_changed:triangle=saw
# Expect: capture_changed:saw=square, capture_changed:square=recorded_shape

0 scenario macro-curve-preview-shapes
80 capture screen source_grid

# Sine
180 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
260 tap MACRO_1 60
1240 tick
1300 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
1430 encoder NAV 1
1560 encoder NAV 1
1710 capture screen sine
1840 tap LEFT_TOP 60

# Triangle
2020 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
2100 tap MACRO_2 60
3080 tick
3140 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
3270 encoder NAV 1
3400 encoder NAV 1
3550 capture screen triangle
3680 tap LEFT_TOP 60

# Saw
3860 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
3940 tap MACRO_3 60
4920 tick
4980 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
5110 encoder NAV 1
5240 encoder NAV 1
5390 capture screen saw
5520 tap LEFT_TOP 60

# Square
5700 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
5780 tap MACRO_4 60
6760 tick
6820 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
6950 encoder NAV 1
7080 encoder NAV 1
7230 capture screen square
